# SIMS - School Information Management System

A School Information Management System built as a backend
development project to demonstrate Java, Spring Boot, Oracle
Database, JPA/Hibernate, REST APIs, and software architecture.

## Technologies

- Java
- Spring Boot
- Spring Data JPA
- Oracle Database
- Maven
- REST API
- Hibernate

## Architecture

The backend follows a layered architecture:

Controller
    ↓
Service
    ↓
Repository
    ↓
Oracle Database

## Main Modules

- Students
- Departments
- Classes
- Subjects/Units
- Enrollments
- Users
- Authentication

## Database

The system uses Oracle Database with relational tables,
primary keys, foreign keys, constraints, and relationships.

## Project Purpose

This project was developed as a portfolio project to demonstrate
backend development skills, database design, Java programming,
REST API development, and layered application architecture.

